{"_id":"eqc0000000000001","name":"Bard","type":"class","img":"systems/eqrmss/assets/Icons/class/hybrid/bard.png","system":{"description":"Unique hybrid class. A musician and fighter who excels at supporting any type of party. Though they cast no spells, their songs emulate spells very well. Most songs are mana free, though there are a few that require mana, hence the mana pool. Great at preventing emergencies, and helpful for managing emergencies if they do happen. Runs extremely fast, and is the only class that can cast non-instant abilities while running. May rely on rather unusual tactics if adventuring solo.","rmssProfession":"eq_bard","eqRole":"hybrid","realm":"essence","armorOverrides":{"heavy":{"rmssProfession":"paladin"}},"groupRoles":["support","puller","crowd_control","utility","dps"],"soloRating":3,"mechanics":{"songs":true,"songTwisting":true,"canCastWhileMoving":true,"crowdControl":true,"pullingTools":true,"burstSupport":true},"spellAccess":{"essence":true,"channeling":false,"mentalism":false,"songs":true},"petType":null,"notes":"Armor DP costs for Heavy armor should be treated like Paladin in RMSS. Bard uses song-based effects rather than traditional spellcasting."}}
{"_id":"eqc0000000000002","name":"Beastlord","type":"class","img":"systems/eqrmss/assets/Icons/class/priest/beastlord.png","system":{"description":"Hybrid Monk/Shaman. A savage fighter who attacks in melee alongside a powerful animal pet, using damaging spells, combat techniques, and support magic to enhance the effort.","rmssProfession":"animist","eqRole":"priest","realm":"channeling","armorOverrides":{},"groupRoles":["dps","support","pet","off_tank"],"soloRating":4,"mechanics":{"petClass":true,"meleeFocus":true,"buffs":true,"debuffs":true,"selfHealing":true},"spellAccess":{"essence":false,"channeling":true,"mentalism":false,"songs":false},"petType":"animal","notes":"Use Animist column in RMSS tables."}}
{"_id":"eqc0000000000003","name":"Berserker","type":"class","img":"systems/eqrmss/assets/Icons/class/tank/berserker.png","system":{"description":"A raging fighter who deals the best melee burst damage, can momentarily stun foes, and is hindered little by enemy positioning or angle of attack. Can generate throwing axes for dealing with foes from a distance.","rmssProfession":"fighter","eqRole":"tank","realm":"none","armorOverrides":{"heavy":{"fixedCost":11}},"groupRoles":["dps","off_tank"],"soloRating":3,"mechanics":{"burstDamage":true,"stunFocus":true,"throwingWeapons":true,"positionalIndependence":true},"spellAccess":{"essence":false,"channeling":false,"mentalism":false,"songs":false},"petType":null,"notes":"Armor DP costs match Fighter except Heavy armor is fixed cost 11."}}
{"_id":"eqc0000000000004","name":"Cleric","type":"class","img":"systems/eqrmss/assets/Icons/class/priest/cleric.png","system":{"description":"An armored priest who possesses the most powerful and varied healing magic. A welcome class in any group, but can also solo with a mercenary.","rmssProfession":"cleric","eqRole":"priest","realm":"channeling","armorOverrides":{},"groupRoles":["heal","support","resurrect"],"soloRating":3,"mechanics":{"primaryHealer":true,"resurrection":true,"defensiveBuffs":true},"spellAccess":{"essence":false,"channeling":true,"mentalism":false,"songs":false},"petType":null,"notes":"Use Cleric column in RMSS tables."}}
{"_id":"eqc0000000000005","name":"Druid","type":"class","img":"systems/eqrmss/assets/Icons/class/priest/druid.png","system":{"description":"A priest of nature who provides strong healing, damaging, and/or support magic, according to the situation. Can use portal spells, and can also solo well.","rmssProfession":"eq_druid","eqRole":"priest","realm":"channeling","armorOverrides":{"heavy":{"fixedCost":11}},"groupRoles":["heal","support","dps","utility"],"soloRating":4,"mechanics":{"natureMagic":true,"teleports":true,"damageSpells":true,"healingSpells":true,"travelUtility":true},"spellAccess":{"essence":true,"channeling":true,"mentalism":false,"songs":false},"petType":null,"notes":"Treat as a custom Druid profession; Heavy armor DP cost fixed at 11."}}
{"_id":"eqc0000000000006","name":"Enchanter","type":"class","img":"systems/eqrmss/assets/Icons/class/caster/enchanter.png","system":{"description":"A mind-bending spellcaster, providing superb support magic and a few pet options. The best class for making emergencies easy to handle, and for enabling allied spellcasters to deal more damage.","rmssProfession":"mentalist","eqRole":"caster","realm":"mentalism","armorOverrides":{},"groupRoles":["support","crowd_control","dps"],"soloRating":3,"mechanics":{"crowdControl":true,"manaBuffs":true,"hasCharmPet":true},"spellAccess":{"essence":false,"channeling":false,"mentalism":true,"songs":false},"petType":"charmed","notes":"Use Mentalist column in RMSS tables."}}
{"_id":"eqc0000000000007","name":"Magician","type":"class","img":"systems/eqrmss/assets/Icons/class/caster/magician.png","system":{"description":"A summoner of four types of powerful elemental pets. Has strong damaging spells, along with some support magic. Particularly strong in single-group content, and can solo effectively.","rmssProfession":"eq_magician","eqRole":"caster","realm":"essence","armorOverrides":{},"groupRoles":["dps","pet","support"],"soloRating":4,"mechanics":{"petClass":true,"elementalPets":true,"directDamageSpells":true,"summoningUtility":true},"spellAccess":{"essence":true,"channeling":false,"mentalism":false,"songs":false},"petType":"elemental","notes":"Uses a custom Magician profession with strong elemental pet focus."}}
{"_id":"eqc0000000000008","name":"Monk","type":"class","img":"systems/eqrmss/assets/Icons/class/tank/monk.png","system":{"description":"A martial artist with very strong burst and sustained damage. Helps prevent emergencies and adapts very well to them if they do happen.","rmssProfession":"warrior_monk","eqRole":"tank","realm":"none","armorOverrides":{},"groupRoles":["dps","off_tank","puller"],"soloRating":4,"mechanics":{"unarmedCombat":true,"burstDamage":true,"sustainedDamage":true,"selfMitigation":true},"spellAccess":{"essence":false,"channeling":false,"mentalism":false,"songs":false},"petType":null,"notes":"Treat as Warrior Monk in RMSS tables."}}
{"_id":"eqc0000000000009","name":"Necromancer","type":"class","img":"systems/eqrmss/assets/Icons/class/caster/necromancer.png","system":{"description":"A spellcaster of death and life-draining. Master of Fire, Disease, Poison and Magic. Has the best sustained spell damage, along with a strong undead pet, and endures emergencies well. One of the best soloing classes throughout the game.","rmssProfession":"eq_necromancer","eqRole":"caster","realm":"essence","armorOverrides":{},"groupRoles":["dps","pet","utility"],"soloRating":5,"mechanics":{"lifetap":true,"damageOverTime":true,"undeadPet":true,"selfSustain":true},"spellAccess":{"essence":true,"channeling":false,"mentalism":false,"songs":false},"petType":"undead","notes":"Uses a dedicated Necromancer profession with strong DoT and lifetap focus."}}
{"_id":"eqc0000000000010","name":"Paladin","type":"class","img":"systems/eqrmss/assets/Icons/class/hybrid/paladin.png","system":{"description":"Hybrid Cleric/Warrior. A holy knight who tanks well, stuns foes, and can heal allies or self more effectively than any other non-priest class, particularly in emergencies. Capable of dealing tremendous damage to the undead.","rmssProfession":"paladin","eqRole":"hybrid","realm":"channeling","armorOverrides":{},"groupRoles":["tank","support","heal"],"soloRating":3,"mechanics":{"stuns":true,"selfHealing":true,"undeadDamageBonus":true},"spellAccess":{"essence":false,"channeling":true,"mentalism":false,"songs":false},"petType":null,"notes":"Use Paladin column in RMSS tables."}}
{"_id":"eqc0000000000011","name":"Ranger","type":"class","img":"systems/eqrmss/assets/Icons/class/hybrid/ranger.png","system":{"description":"Hybrid Druid/Warrior. A forester who deals strong sustained damage from near or far and can provide limited healing in a pinch. Performs well in brief emergencies, but is more fragile overall than other warrior hybrids. An expert at tracking creatures, and at shooting a bow.","rmssProfession":"ranger","eqRole":"hybrid","realm":"channeling","armorOverrides":{},"groupRoles":["dps","off_tank","support","puller"],"soloRating":3,"mechanics":{"archeryFocus":true,"tracking":true,"limitedHealing":true},"spellAccess":{"essence":true,"channeling":true,"mentalism":false,"songs":false},"petType":null,"notes":"Use Ranger column in RMSS tables."}}
{"_id":"eqc0000000000012","name":"Rogue","type":"class","img":"systems/eqrmss/assets/Icons/class/tank/rogue.png","system":{"description":"A conniving fighter who, if attacking from behind, deals the best sustained melee damage and has strong burst capability. Great at scouting and corpse recovery, using advanced stealth abilities to escape detection by foes. The only class that can prepare poisons. Needs the help of a mercenary to solo effectively.","rmssProfession":"thief","eqRole":"tank","realm":"none","armorOverrides":{},"groupRoles":["dps","scout","utility"],"soloRating":2,"mechanics":{"backstab":true,"stealth":true,"corpseRecovery":true,"poisonCrafting":true},"spellAccess":{"essence":false,"channeling":false,"mentalism":false,"songs":false},"petType":null,"notes":"Use Thief column in RMSS tables; add poison crafting subsystem."}}
{"_id":"eqc0000000000013","name":"Shadowknight","type":"class","img":"systems/eqrmss/assets/Icons/class/hybrid/shadowknight.png","system":{"description":"Necromancer/warrior hybrid. An unholy knight with the best aggro control among the tank classes. Can assist with healing self by draining health from foes, and has a weak but useful undead pet. In an emergency, can use Harm Touch to devastate a single foe.","rmssProfession":"eq_shadowknight","eqRole":"hybrid","realm":"channeling","armorOverrides":{},"groupRoles":["tank","dps","pet"],"soloRating":4,"mechanics":{"lifetap":true,"harmTouch":true,"undeadPet":true,"strongAggroControl":true},"spellAccess":{"essence":true,"channeling":true,"mentalism":false,"songs":false},"petType":"undead","notes":"Uses a custom Shadow Knight profession; DP costs based on Paladin with necromantic spell access."}}
{"_id":"eqc0000000000014","name":"Shaman","type":"class","img":"systems/eqrmss/assets/Icons/class/priest/shaman.png","system":{"description":"A priest of spirits who excels at weakening foes and empowering allies, particularly melee fighters. Also provides strong healing, has a decent pet, and deals decent damage with spells when no healing or support is currently needed. The only class that can make potions.","rmssProfession":"magent","eqRole":"priest","realm":"channeling","armorOverrides":{},"groupRoles":["support","heal","pet","dps"],"soloRating":4,"mechanics":{"buffs":true,"debuffs":true,"potions":true,"spiritMagic":true,"petClass":true},"spellAccess":{"essence":false,"channeling":true,"mentalism":false,"songs":false},"petType":"spirit","notes":"Use Magent column in RMSS tables."}}
{"_id":"eqc0000000000015","name":"Warrior","type":"class","img":"systems/eqrmss/assets/Icons/class/tank/warrior.png","system":{"description":"The fundamental tank. Mitigates incoming damage better than any other class and possesses strong aggro control and good melee damage output. Can act as a living shield for an ally during emergencies. Needs the help of a mercenary to solo effectively.","rmssProfession":"fighter","eqRole":"tank","realm":"none","armorOverrides":{},"groupRoles":["tank","dps"],"soloRating":2,"mechanics":{"primaryTank":true,"damageMitigation":true,"aggroControl":true},"spellAccess":{"essence":false,"channeling":false,"mentalism":false,"songs":false},"petType":null,"notes":"Use Fighter column in RMSS tables."}}
{"_id":"eqc0000000000016","name":"Wizard","type":"class","img":"systems/eqrmss/assets/Icons/class/caster/wizard.png","system":{"description":"A seeker of raw magical power. Uses spells to cause the best burst damage among all classes, and has potent stunning magic. Can use portal spells. One of the best soloing classes at higher levels.","rmssProfession":"sorcerer","eqRole":"caster","realm":"essence","armorOverrides":{},"groupRoles":["dps","utility"],"soloRating":4,"mechanics":{"burstDamage":true,"stuns":true,"teleports":true},"spellAccess":{"essence":true,"channeling":false,"mentalism":false,"songs":false},"petType":null,"notes":"Remapped to Sorcerer for better alignment with high-damage Essence casting."}}
